       "            style=\"position-anchor: --doc-link-max_categories;\">\n",
       "            max_categories: int, default=None<br><br>Specifies an upper limit to the number of output features for each input<br>feature when considering infrequent categories. If there are infrequent<br>categories, `max_categories` includes the category representing the<br>infrequent categories along with the frequent categories. If `None`,<br>there is no limit to the number of output features.<br><br>.. versionadded:: 1.1<br>    Read more in the :ref:`User Guide &lt;encoder_infrequent_categories&gt;`.</span>\n",
